---
source: crates/lsw-cli/src/cli.rs
expression: "render_help(&[\"build\"])"
---
Build Windows artifacts using native Linux tools

Usage: build [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --system <SYSTEM>  Force a build system instead of auto-detection [possible values: cmake, cargo, make, ninja, meson, zig, dotnet, explicit]
      --update-lock      Refresh lsw.lock instead of failing on drift
      --reproducible     Zero PE timestamps for reproducible, byte-identical artifacts
      --aot              Compile C# with `NativeAOT` to a native PE (dotnet projects only)
  -h, --help             Print help (see more with '--help')
